  "description": "The Romax Adventure 2.0 is our most budget friendly Performance Drop Bar Gravel bike in the Romax line up. It is also the most “Gravel” in the line, meaning the most “relaxed” and easy to ride in technical single track of all the Romax Bikes. If that’s your thing ! And if it isn’t your thing, it should be, because it’s tons of fun! The Romax Adventure 2.0 is a do-it-all adventure adventure bike that excels at gravel riding, bike touring, bike packing, a go anywhere bike! The updated 1 X 11 Speed drivetrain excels in its simplicity and reliability. With more than enough \"Adventure” gearing with a 40T Crank paired with a 11-42T Cassette and a clutched rear derailleur allow for secure adventuring in any terrain. A full carbon fork with plenty of tire clearance and a frame ready for fenders and racks creates year round cycling possibilities.",
